# Converted from the old Grade 2 Survex data (Grade2/Grade2/TheScore.svx).

# > Ogof Draenen: The Score
# 
# This data represents a fairly rough compass & tape survey with
# occasional estimated clino readings.
# 
# Survey conducted on Monday 2nd January by Morgannwg Caving Club.
# Surveyed by: Ali Garman & Huw Jnes
# Data entry: Ali Garman

survey thescore

# Station Equivalences

# Specify units of measurement

# Magnetic North to Grid North correction
# Mag deviation at the time of the readings (9-Oct-94) was
# 4.2 degrees (data from OS sheet 161, 1991).

# Data ordering

centreline
  # BCRA2
  sd length 0.5 metres
  sd compass clino 2.5 degrees
  calibrate compass 4.2
  data normal from to length compass clino
  1	2	19.7	320	0	# continues smaller!!
  2	3	13.3	337	0	# chamber 4m*6m
  3	4	19.0	320	0	# connecting passage bedding
  # alternative underneath
  # 4 = side of next chamber
  4	5	11.0	30	0	# side passage
  5	6	5.7	111	0
  6	7	4.0	318	0	# mud filled end probably bypass
  # to station 13
  4	8	12.5	326	0	# centre of chamber
  8	9	8.3	290	0	# rift continues
  8	10	7.6	28	-20	# exit chamber
  10	11	11.8	348	0
  11	12	11.5	19	0	# back into 3m*3m passage
  # tube in wall between 12 and 14
  12	13	16.9	155	0
  12	14	19.9	321	0
  14	15	7.8	60	0	# side passage
  15	16	4.0	107	0	# limit of exploration at T-junction
  14	17	17.7	350	0
  17	18	20.3	310	0	# it was only a 20m tape!!!
  18	19	20.0	331	0
  19	20	20.1	320	0	# side passage
  20	21	20.3	338	0
  21	22	14.3	345	0	# 22 = OO station 1
  22	23	16.7	344	0
  23	24	6.5	351	0
  24	25	8.0	323	0
  25	26	12.8	328	0
  26	27	6.3	310	-20	# end of crawl into bigger stuff
  27	28	9.4	330	0
  28	29	4.0	1	+20
  29	30	8.8	344	0	# mud dig in large passage

  # continuation of the score done by A, P & B on 7/1/95

endcentreline
survey ext

centreline
